    "preamble": "Dineshkumar Mohanlal Sheth vs Vadodara Municipal Corpn. @ Vadodara ... on 30 November, 2015 Author: K.M.Thaker Bench: K.M.Thaker C/Ca/11934/2015 Order",
    "facts": "The affidavit dated 24.12.2009 of the Employees of Respondent Corporation viz. Shri.Pareshkumar Mohanlal Sheth are annexed herewith Annexure No.'S' Collectivley as the documentary evidence for my survival on legitmate and the constitutional petitioner's all income and expenditure, during my illegal and unconstitutional all the retrenchment-suspensions-Degradations- Removals periods and during pendecy of same cause of actioned all past petitions. Viz. Special Civil Application No. nos.750 of 1998, 66655 of 2001 and 19748 of 2007 with all civil applications thereunder including current Special Civil Applications with five Civil Application thereunder. From the relief prayed for by the petitioner, it has emerged that essentially the applicant has prayed for fixing the date for final hearing of the petition.",
